# Build prerequisites installed into the managed base layer.
# None required on the 2026-11-05 Debian 13 (trixie) snapshot: uv installs
# from its digest-pinned release archive and Python comes from the digest-pinned
# base image. If a future prerequisite needs a source build, list it here and
# pin it in build-requirements.lock; automatic build-isolation downloads stay
# disabled so an unaccounted build dependency fails the build instead of resolving.
